WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.960
I'm the President of the United States,

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:03.120
but I worry about Europe.

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.720
I love Europe. I love the people of Europe.

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:08.520
And I hate to see it being devastated

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:11.160
by energy and immigration.

